*   **File:** `k8s/base/deployment-media-workers.yaml`
    *   **Summary:** Defines the dedicated media worker deployment with 4 vCPU/4Gi limits, `/tmp` EmptyDir volume, `QUARKUS_SCHEDULER_ENABLED`, priority filter env var, and FFmpeg path injection. It exposes annotations for Prometheus scraping and intentionally runs the same image as the core service today.
    *   **Recommendation:** Update this manifest per task goals—make it a CRITICAL-only worker if needed, ensure container image includes FFmpeg binary (or reference a separate image tag), and wire any new config/env knobs (timeouts, semaphore size, kill switches) so operators can tune video workloads without changing code.

